{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1578,
  "batch_count": 1700,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "00997feec5b141ad09b64325996734abf32644bb",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8cc4aaa9541967ff0993e6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你正兴奋着呢。\n挺好。对于旅行的伙伴来说，\n那可是必不可少的要素。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26bcdc1801b270f46ed1ee5b1068cf74280f2d40785a4ffeb2f0f629eab423ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b1955d2b4fccfbdee8b3403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与你的这场旅行，究竟会抵达何方呢\n……真想在这漫长的途中，\n彻底品味个够啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "148ceb3f89c41384f752f80885ff65db703ae90f937eb2be7a4244e67fc71eab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a11c39ace62622d1734dbe86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旅途要有伴……虽然不知道\n是谁说的——但和你在一起，\n我也明白这句话的意思了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97bb8d3572653fbf84b2803aa55b16a8c548e0f4bbb212da23e909ee06829879",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab55512ad1f1963dde35d50d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热……不过，真是个不错的地方。\n等太阳下山后，我们去看看\n海岸线到底延伸到哪儿了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b74f56aab0f57788b1a728e9434ad6827c7cf811d18938c7d9b7e1d3122b3b57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8f0372164922f4e50656711",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，接下来要去哪里呢……你会来的吧？当然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1a5757a725c4eeea1e1f9769ce9070132c0bd0dd363578c5d906380ea3782d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe039529a60b6815e88f2e64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会忘记的。那是一段，绝佳的旅程。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d4d0d618859e5d0a22bccac654c83f69fb7993057b7acf893306ffee9c59a67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fced84b276e4b83c48c64684",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旅途的终点……或许能看见呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc3b3d027b5cb72f8db5050596f90d1f9289a8e6874fb49f727807becbd399b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a03ae68b23deaed241d90f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以说是，新的旅途已经开启了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99419fde5f5e0dbcffb1b91bc6ce21b8e59b8007af0171ec9a0b00adcf226861",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a3876bf303c001eba265e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是黄金旅程。让我们来一场精彩的旅行吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ac89d8492d98590b73277067b6a60b94b8c8e6982c4f10adce0b75ea6a879d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81838e1c310df75349ced86f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么——这次又会抵达何方呢？\n要跟上来吗？跟上这趟黄金之旅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e85c44596d5a36f1a36986e58725c296f369993fc1f59026fd580936f1e224",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da9607f28c0be606e89f973d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，下一个目的地是……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c42853f960d447d4578474f66f48bf0f3f45c7c932fd933b6502ec396e3b7af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:498cdba7304f7fbf5413d657",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看看能走到哪儿去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7814c8b7b8f2b70978433d3e102c37461592ccb2d9f881c4b9c2297fdb9bee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2af56e92599561aa54d3e39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "由我来施以救赎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf3f00d9ac6ccffb60c8e959aef24cc40813e8d4e84cccc96c66f0eca90a2273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc3ddebed0de8375f1959eb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誓约已牢不可破地缔结。\r\n还请您全力指导我。\r\n一切考验我都必将克服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "293362df7e8c5f9942e2e308a5dc6aa435ecfcdecfd9d120fd580ac235973323",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4705b29c4e739cc48865db5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cdf149af1be7d5deedbfda5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:198461bb78f90c40f5863c8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若是在异界迷失了方向，\r\n我便会叩问驻留于心中的您。\r\n因为您就是我的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec23b811cb3649184dd0ed3be2ee9887c48e0813a931afd524f0c4f2d3df655a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e64f2a82b2efd90661aa1b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要去巡访您\n充满回忆的故地呢？\n这也将成为属于我们两人的轨迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad75db248071f869e922a1cbf5827af2ba46f6f2aa3285f9c5a2038dd67ac593",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f8c5a0bb5b464b7e75351b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "御守、破魔矢……在此就由\n圣女的祈祷赐予更深厚的加护吧！\n训练员，您也一定要来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c29e09cbb84b3098384f02e52322f3c8b48e16fb8348c7e9f1ca6ba0a95e566",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6c3b6320ebb985b87062cb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力的隔水加热失败了……不过，\r\n这也是上天降下的试炼！我定会让它\r\n转生为至高巧克力，敬请期待吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75c0b5295b6cd5131be395d791777c83a451006734dd5bcd69c4a3ba3bc1cf5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd9eac045dad4fb8d797f63e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "历经仿佛永恒的漫长旅途……终于\r\n找到了。请品尝这裹着精灵恩赐的\r\n果仁糖吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "28538db3f83daa9714873eede8e1e5cd2d1b8cdd9d4690560242f9f9f807b20a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d82478cf34a0acf426ea3d11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让献给上天的诸多心愿得以传达，\r\n我将全力解放圣女之力……呜呼，\r\n天之长河啊！请倾听我的祈愿吧——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71a250a8ab8a96317973ffd41b78817ddedea1c936f08287dcc7ba9b98775e22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:721d685378e62893e2d11d6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节……黑暗力量暴涨的一夜……\r\n请千万不要离开我的身旁。\r\n我会用神圣结界来守护您的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdc787f36a9f281157dafc445aad8271238492e99810300b28aef0baf062fdeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2b27f83b2ce37d596404f2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呼，这正是圣夜！恩宠之日！\r\n我竟然能获赐咖啡同学\r\n亲手培育的咖啡生豆……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac62aea94b953c3b2f32ca704b021f1592055c5e8b290692a2e66877c40fafd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36dfebbe92e3999dcee3dfbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "街市披上了繁星的装束，被\n光芒的加护所笼罩。我们要不要\n也一同前去，承领这份恩赐呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c1c2d9a1c4e0e3e211251db2c77e420fb393e8aedb3da8489cd85267b82616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53e467cf02b3894421af5fbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢这份恩宠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2670ceb355fa3617f40be4983b983fa85f8cdae328f3619620f76378e178b5ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b08ef6c8bc3a8c337965cc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到岁末都必须精进自身。\r\n明年定要抵达全新境界，\r\n推开那扇异界之门！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1773a6453f0ff628a0231ae5656251a78d85dd7523ca02d761e09d16d32ea050",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0cb72e7f32a535059cac4e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已前往试炼之地巡礼归来。\r\n恭喜您，您这健康平安的一年\r\n已被许诺保障了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "511605c41a7692d6ce2494de0f0684c57d002d81bbd508c092957d9552066c47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0654c65b718d1f708cd613d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您的诞生，实乃天赐的奇迹。\r\n是被派往尘世的指引之光！\r\n呜呼……谨致感恩……并献上祝福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3495f8ba62734a8d223bf9773a9d12698b454ffd9d9a371459e5e6b4f50a6202",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d73a5760f195441940f1a037",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "景致同学还没来吗……\n约定的乐园……胡萝卜料理美味的\n餐馆，快带我前往吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d44f72ce6b511f3a84cfac38c5596e379a0e82940dfabb069007d69177c9e333",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cb646dc4b6ea8faa8554cd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呼，终于……呵呵，\r\n是心底的呼唤传达给您了吧。\r\n来吧，请带我启程……前往庆宴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67a9410c37552245e32a9ad982e628dab742c67d1e991cdadfa82e4c3429b37f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35eb1be96b93553230523adb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到通知了。\r\n愿它化作照亮黑暗的路标，\r\n为您指引前路……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5e67db6b9a94f5d3ad35463038cf9a2ff6a3c1ffcd83e23c2a2d6937b8f0be9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33bc6b13cad9480e1ce138bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了。\r\n让我们感谢这崇高的恩赐吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e82e1910d92564735bb51ed495dfce300e364467c4d72e0644b3b8ad5f8a73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d7b8b0fa15e20719dca55ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您已达成任务了呢。\r\n愿祝福降临于您的钻研之上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb919fd815e3d519b21e7bcd23495daae845b4cb9ca20afa7a06c3aa3b835ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47c6cfb3a34bfbe8aa8e9acf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已有活动预告了呢。\r\n为了迎接宿命之日，我要蓄积力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "332ccd079ce6def41281f6824d9ada5ef479dbb0ee0bb2ab8fae715fb9b2621b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1ff040ec863586ea071e1b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了。\r\n呵呵，庆典真教人欢欣雀跃呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "d409729467c146a18425f0eac67803735fd3f721c60fb572cf4be18c4e0be03b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e04b5c5abccb8274b933944f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当下当经受试炼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8239cfada974a71e05fd8300104b65db6dff528ca6f20ed282a0fcbb4f44f4ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e218df814caa5cec8077a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了。\r\n当作为智慧之书，广为流布。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3c9dfcf2e58af86643db36797f12aee3e25f72815a5f08eaef669fc388cf61b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56655bb3135b87405b675f78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将寄宿于衣裳的神圣群星之加护，\r\n倾注于这世间吧。即便天光隐曜的\r\n晦暗之日，亦可高枕无忧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "406ad45badceb4cb1e657c9ae0aa86808c6f371aa5c40fbfeb43b7fee2134c7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30b583f677f4f32059bc625d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看，这缎带上的装饰。\r\n明丽的金芒乃是纯洁的光辉……\r\n在商店里我一眼便相中了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e69858a44a6e232cd78cb3a69ae38a8f02e699a20d812be5a27600da4011412",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1007dfda0348827a2e398b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息日我都会手洗衣物。\r\n在专注洗净污渍的过程中，\r\n心中的杂念沉渣也能一并涤除。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a70d5c75a75e89a53817e771a7fa5508f9928ffbdf43649061633a2df710114c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2a2282c364e07ae00992f7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "均衡并未打破……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57ef408d5854306431c451741bfc638c01becabae64a42dc0a4ae453d9cb9572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
