      "source_text": "坚信不疑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4e29b288e76a9dc71fe4fe7f61d093ca1196015f212db2ae18c62973e5a2511",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9394b2f2e8e4b5ef7c7f3d0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "救赎之手……",
      "source_fingerprint": "129fdf1b3a16264c1ee39ddc258cb5a5f8dc80ecdddf218b493388985d24b45d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d996710a3024480dad9dc5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6fe24f2f3c66352ab4820d461f8273d7fe5237e93a7f8a467fc486ca20c2ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bf745adb0d7540303357a9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您正在集中精神吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ec9a8d6831c814fdd162513aba952b8178edf7800b63dd3d83b8cab0a442c65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d10f3ff74d3bd8346a2c0c11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎会如此……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b6eb4ab495bf7bc925f68b73b6edb9ee16551f5c3964a4f39073ea1761b8ded",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba95102100efd41c4f1ac1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来日方长……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff578add2eeb1db5d0650a79a282a68e0719039e5187f463a54a5dcf75c12b5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fcc8c9e399c2e17eebd0500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明日亦可获赐此物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a61c3db53ad30f9cfc821ae82a4e2101bfa103fb2590ad1bcb16a7f196a492",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a5dcffa349184e942f7ff6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……这也是试炼，\r\n我必能跨越给您看……呜呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8b1b644a88d786fb24cb7551a6d7218f9f7062a0d93a6e57d57273f37ff935d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c508970d63d639eb78c9943",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦……深渊正在向我招手……！\r\n必须献上祈求康复的祷告……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf4032ea9c1a694ca7416c4d42ca8c763c0d78f369a13e2a19e8d58d1dcef182",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806b8b02e700c60ec351e08e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "此身充盈着祝福之光，\r\n即便超乎常理的特训亦不足为惧。\r\n任何使命我皆坦然受领！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c6ede9388601b94e89aa9b6af0f2bfa273235db6ff63d1b4c33487a2d677caf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95ac8fdc87e12b6866312e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肥沃的大地啊。澄澈的天空啊——\r\n凭借获赐的庞大玛娜，\r\n纯洁之身必将开辟崭新境界！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1f96fb86d55331e248cb557b0ec482c4e65d5680adeda2861356789d4bca742",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20003"
      ]
    }
  ]
